    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the UniversityGrants Commission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act,establishing the South Eastern University of Sri Lanka, published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 916/7 of March 27,1996 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2100/12 of December 05, 2018), by theaddition immediately after the entry \u2018\u2018 (c). Department of Management and Information Technology\u2019\u2019 appearing inColumn II of the Schedule II to such Order, which corresponds to the item \u2018\u2018Faculty of Management and Commerce\u2019\u2019appearing in Column I of that Schedule of the following new entry :-",
